ect identifier (payment card number).    |\n| `email`        | tokenise    | high           | Direct identifier (email address).          |\n| `holder`       | tokenise    | high           | Likely a name or identifier.                |\n| `merchant_id`  | hash        | medium         | Indirect identifier (device/merchant ID).   |\n| `txn_id`       | hash        | medium         | Indirect identifier (transaction ID).       |\n| `amount`       | drop        | low            | Not PII, but may be sensitive.              |\n| `currency`     | drop        | low            | Not PII, but may be redundant.              |\n| `decline_reason` | mask      | low            | May contain sensitive information.         |\n| `event_ts`     | drop        | low            | Timestamp, not PII.                         |\n| `status`       | drop        | low            | Not PII.                                    |\n\n---\n\n### **JSON Patch Proposal**\nHere is the **proposed** patch for the `pii` block of the feed descriptor:\n```json\n{\n  "pii": {\n    "fields": {\n      "card_no": {"action": "tokenise", "confidence": "high", "reason": "Direct identifier (payment card number)."},\n      "email": {"action": "tokenise", "confidence": "high", "reason": "Direct identifier (email address)."},\n      "holder": {"action": "tokenise", "confidence": "high", "reason": "Likely a name or identifier."},\n      "merchant_id": {"action": "hash", "confidence": "medium", "reason": "Indirect identifier (device/merchant ID)."},\n      "txn_id": {"action": "hash", "confidence": "medium", "reason": "Indirect identifier (transaction ID)."},\n      "amount": {"action": "drop", "confidence": "low", "reason": "Not PII, but may be sensitive."},\n      "currency": {"action": "drop", "confidence": "low", "reason": "Not PII, but may be redundant."},\n      "decline_reason": {"action": "mask", "confidence": "low", "reason": "May contain sensitive information."},\n      "event_ts": {"action": "drop", "confidence": "low", "reason": "Timestamp, not PII."},\n      "status": {"action": "drop", "confidence": "low", "reason": "Not PII."}\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n**Note**: This is a **proposal only**. No changes have been applied or approved. Further validation with correct sample data is required.'}
